## 2. Synchronization and your files

Download and installation are free. Helenite synchronization requires a valid subscription or an expressly offered trial. The service terms and the plan presented before purchase govern service access, prices and limits. This license does not promise unlimited storage, traffic, devices, support or service availability.

You retain ownership of your notes and attachments. Expiry, cancellation or closure of your Helenite account does not remove your right to open, copy or export files already stored in your local vaults using Obsidian or other suitable software. It does not authorize Egress to erase those vaults. A subscription is not a company-hosted vault backup. Keep independent backups and protect your devices and keys.

